---
interface Props {
  class?: string;
}
const { class: className } = Astro.props;
---

<figure class:list={["circuit", className]}>
  <div class="circuit__board">
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 420 230"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="circuit-title circuit-desc"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    >
      <title id="circuit-title">LED circuit diagram</title>
      <desc id="circuit-desc">
        An Arduino output pin connects through a resistor to an LED. The LED connects back to the
        Arduino's ground pin, completing the loop. The resistor limits the current through the LED.
      </desc>

      <rect class="block" x="10" y="28" width="92" height="186" rx="8" />
      <text class="label label--strong" x="56" y="58" text-anchor="middle">ARDUINO</text>
      <text class="label" x="94" y="85" text-anchor="end">PIN</text>
      <text class="label" x="94" y="201" text-anchor="end">GND</text>

      <path class="wire" d="M102 80 H150" />
      <path class="wire" d="M210 80 H262" />
      <path class="wire" d="M296 80 H404 V196 H102" />
      <circle class="node" cx="102" cy="80" r="4.5" />
      <circle class="node" cx="102" cy="196" r="4.5" />

      <path class="flow" d="M122 72 l7 8 -7 8" />
      <path class="flow" d="M396 132 l8 7 8 -7" />
      <path class="flow" d="M172 188 l-7 8 7 8" />
      <text class="label label--flow" x="196" y="219" text-anchor="middle">CURRENT</text>

      <path class="wire" d="M150 80 L156 66 L166 94 L176 66 L186 94 L196 66 L204 80 H210" />
      <text class="label" x="180" y="124" text-anchor="middle">RESISTOR</text>

      <path class="led" d="M262 60 V100 L296 80 Z" />
      <path class="wire" d="M296 60 V100" />
      <path class="glow" d="M276 52 l11 -15 M281 37 h6 v6" />
      <path class="glow" d="M290 56 l11 -15 M295 41 h6 v6" />
      <text class="label" x="279" y="124" text-anchor="middle">LED</text>

      <text class="label" x="255" y="156" text-anchor="middle">OHM'S LAW</text>
      <text class="formula" x="255" y="182" text-anchor="middle">V = I × R</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span class="annot">Diagram</span>
    <span>A basic LED circuit. Current flows from the Arduino pin through the resistor and LED back to ground. The resistor keeps the current low enough that the LED doesn't burn out.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .circuit {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    max-width: 32rem;
  }

  .circuit__board {
    padding: clamp(0.75rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #d9d4c8 1.4px, transparent 1.6px);
    background-size: 16px 16px;
    background-position: 8px 8px;
  }

  svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .block {
    fill: var(--color-surface);
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .wire {
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .node {
    fill: currentColor;
  }

  .led {
    fill: var(--brand-yellow);
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .glow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--brand-blue);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .flow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--brand-blue);
    stroke-width: 2.25;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    fill: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .label--strong {
    fill: var(--color-text);
  }

  .label--flow {
    fill: var(--brand-blue);
  }

  .formula {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 500;
    fill: var(--color-text);
  }

  figcaption {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
